# local working files at the repo root — never commit:
# raw recordings / media dumps (94 MB .mov etc.)
/*.mov
/*.mp4
/*.m4a
/*.pdf
/Screen Recording*
# demo-GIF staging (sources + generators live here until promoted to assets/)
/media-staging/
# internal evaluation / planning notes (contain unsanitized names & meetings)
/talkthrough-mcp-*.md
/findings-*.md
/plan-*.md
